            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to the use of a composition based on bacteria and/or yeasts and/or other microorganisms, taken singularly or in combination, for the treatment of the symptoms of and/or for treating Irritable Bowel Syndrome (IBS) or also similar pathologies affecting the gastrointestinal apparatus. In particular, the bacteria are selected from the following genera: Lactobacillus, Bifidobacterium, Bacillus, Propionibacterium, Streptococcus, Lactococcus, Aerococcus and Enterococcus.</p>
            </abstract>
